What the hell just happened back there? Dominic is dead? This was supposed to be my big break too. Shit, shit, shit! -> choices

== choices
+ Where were you when the murder happened?
Well, me and Dominic were just wrapping up our scene, and we were about to move onto the next one. It was only us on stage right before the murder. I went back to go take a drink, and then suddenly the lights went out. Then the light got fixed and I saw my co-star dead, on the ground! That’s all I know, honest! -> choices
+ In the last scene of the play, you seemed to have a prop gun, could it have been loaded?
Well, it's a prop gun. It couldn’t be used to kill or threaten someone. It's loaded with blanks. I’m no detective, but if someone was in a rush to kill someone, usually they leave their weapon on the crime scene in a rush. -> choices
+ Your clothing seems torn up, any reason that happened? 
Well, it must’ve been from the rush from seeing the body. The attacker could have been anywhere, I had to get out of there! However, I do recall seeing that lady in dark blue get her dress torn up. Maybe she left something out on the stage? -> choices
+ I have nothing left to ask.
Hurry, we gotta find whoever did this! -> END
